<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank rates were</p>
<p>unchanged for the second time in two weeks, the central bank</p>
<p>said on Wenesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Nothing has really happened over the last few weeks with no</p>
<p>deals longer than one week,&quot; said Egi Metsandi trader with</p>
<p>Hansapank's interest rate products department.</p>
<p>&quot;Banks' liquidity is high and no new funds have been</p>
<p>offered,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>  TALIBOR/TALIBID   1Week	 1Month    3Month</p>
<p>  June 25	   4.13/3.13  5.45/4.45  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>  July 02	   4.13/3.13  5.45/4.45  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>Every Wednesday, the central bank releases average weighted</p>
<p>interest rates for interbank loans.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
